{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23830","headline":"和杨师臯伤小姬英英 · 白居易","name":"和杨师臯伤小姬英英","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"自从娇騃一相依，共见杨花七度飞。\n玳瑁牀空收枕席，琵琶弦断倚屏帏。\n人间有梦何曾入，泉下无家岂是归。\n坟上少啼留取泪，明年寒食更沾衣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23830.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23830","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}